625 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 624 0 R
  /Alt (Two scatter plots side by side with total hours played on the horizontal axis. The left panel plots SPANE balance score (range negative 6 to 6) and the right panel plots enjoyment score (range 1 to 7). In each panel, individual data points are coloured by playstyle and overlaid with linear regression lines and shaded 95 percent confidence bands. In both panels, Casual PvE Players (blue) and Elite Allround Players (green) show upward-sloping lines indicating positive associations between playtime and outcomes. Casual PvP Players (orange) show a nearly flat line in both panels, indicating no meaningful association. Confidence bands are widest at higher hours values where data are sparser. Most data points cluster below 20 hours of total play.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [0]
  /Pg 1027 0 R
>>
endobj

