<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 691 0 R
  /Alt (Three radar charts arranged in a 2-by-2 grid with a shared legend in the fourth cell. Each chart plots 10 performance metrics (PvE Ratio, PvE K/D, PvE Accuracy, PvE Score, PvE DPS, PvP Ratio, PvP K/D, PvP Accuracy, PvP Score, PvP DPS) on radial axes scaled from 0 to 1. A dashed grey polygon marks the average player profile. The Casual PvE Players chart shows high values on all PvE metrics and low values on PvP metrics, creating a lopsided shape skewed toward PvE. The Elite Allround Players chart shows uniformly high values across both PvE and PvP metrics, forming a large, roughly symmetric polygon that exceeds the average on nearly every axis. The Casual PvP Players chart shows elevated PvP Ratio but otherwise below-average values on most performance metrics, with especially low PvE scores. The legend identifies the dashed grey line as Average Player and three coloured filled polygons as the three playstyles.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
